sequenceDiagram
  participant A as AI Agent 90
  participant C as Agent Interface 30
  participant G as Gateway Module 20
  participant P as Permission Manager 70
  participant E as Browser Operation Link 10
  participant T as Browser Tab 40
  participant L as Audit Record 60

  A->>C: command/API/message
  C->>G: JSON request over communication path 80
  G->>P: check permitted tab
  alt tab permitted
    G->>E: command over communication path 80
    E->>T: debug API, annotation overlay, or structured operation
    T-->>E: result
    E-->>G: result
    G->>L: record operation audit entry
    G-->>C: JSON response
    C-->>A: command output
  else tab not permitted
    G->>L: record rejected request
    G-->>C: error
    C-->>A: error output
  end
